{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Jisoo親自分享辛拉麵食法</p><p>BLACKPINK 成員 Jisoo 在個人 YouTube 頻道上傳的Vlog 中，分享了一個讓粉絲大開眼界的零食吃法：將辛拉麵生麵餅直接捏碎，沾取包裝內的調味粉當零食吃，完全跳過煮麵流程。</p><p>直接生食麵餅＋沾辣粉</p><p>字幕更打上「Jisoo 最愛的零食」。 對習慣把辛拉麵煮成熱湯麵的人來說，這種乾吃方式確實很有反差感。吃法曝光後，粉絲反應熱烈，不少人笑說「第一次看到有人這樣吃辛拉麵」，也有人猜測 Jisoo 可能太愛吃辣，直接沾粉包才夠味。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257682221159302_6268418026ad88d366ff24.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257682384991950_787077406ad88d38172e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1792576825245932_11820150116ad88d39a1681.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.404653+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:39.956807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:39.956807+00:00","content_hash":"ba464c20e203782bf8844c300fb95910c41d6199953c94d0014e8ae2164e580d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}